<title>SOUTH KOREA: Ssangyong Oil 1997 turnaround schedule.</title>
<headline>Ssangyong Oil 1997 turnaround schedule.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Oil Refining Co, a unit of Ssangyong Group, said on Monday its schedule for routine maintenance closure of its crude distillation units (CDUs) in 1997 was as follows (capacity in barrels per day):</p>
<p>	CDU		    CAPACITY     CLOSURE SCHEDULE</p>
<p>    Onsan 1		   93,000	late May-mid June</p>
<p>    Onsan 2		  150,000	late April-mid May</p>
<p>    Onsan 3		  200,000	five days in early April</p>
<p>						  five days in early Oct</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
